{"id":"5102","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5102_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>照片显示，卷积云是一系列薄而透明的高级云层，其为明亮的白色，没有阴影。相当<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">光滑的镜片形状</span> 将它们确定为荚状云云种；有些包含一个微弱的、精细的内部结构。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jarmo Koistinen","location":"芬兰埃斯波","latitude":"纬度: 60° 12' 0'' N","longitude":"经度: 24° 42' 0'' E","date":"03 November 2015 1215 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.2.2"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5102_syn_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>850 hPa的位势图显示了一条穿过芬兰南部的暖脊线，有一个强烈的西风上流。这一天芬兰11月最温暖的气温记录。   </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© www.wetter3.de","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5102_upper_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>芬兰Jokioinen（WMO 02963）的探测是在拍摄拍照后两小时开展的，距离西北90公里。它显示出340 hPa（8 500 m）以上是潮湿层，即图像中云的估计高度。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/5102_sat_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在云照片前10分钟拍摄的NOAA-19图像是第3、4和5通道的组合。它显示了芬兰南部薄薄的高层云的碎片。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 芬兰气象局","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4809_main_cirrocumulus-lenticularis_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p>卷积荚状云云种，出现在<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">形状像镜片或杏仁的斑块</span>中。它们通常<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">非常细长</span>，通常具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">清晰的轮廓</span>。云片大多数是光滑的，整体都是非常白的。这个图像整体显示出明显的波状，使其成为波状云云类。它还显示出在卷积云中有时会看到一些小的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">横向波纹</span>。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Pascual","location":"西班牙瓦伦西亚塞拉","latitude":"纬度: 39° 40' 55'' N","longitude":"经度: 0° 27' 35'' W","date":"18 March 2015 1506 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 0, CH= 9","code":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.2.2"}]}]}